          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_large_language_models_reason_over",
          "text": "Large language models reason over tables, but only a few cells usually matter for any given question, and the irrelevant cells act as noise that hurts accuracy.",
