          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_large_language_models_known_suscepti",
          "text": "Large language models are known to be susceptible to such distracting information, so their table reasoning degrades, and the problem gets worse as tables grow larger and carry even more irrelevant content.",
