        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_first_unsupervised_relevance_scorer",
          "text": "First, an Unsupervised Relevance Scorer assigns a soft relevance weight to every table token and is trained differentiably alongside the question-answering model.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "first",
            "unsupervised",
            "relevance",
            "scorer",
            "assigns",
            "soft",
            "relevance",
            "weight",
            "every",
            "table"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_second_weakly_supervised_module_gene",
          "text": "Second, a weakly-supervised module generates a parsing statement describing which rows and columns matter, then highlights the corresponding cells to produce a cell-based relevance signal.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "second",
            "weakly-supervised",
            "module",
            "generates",
            "parsing",
            "statement",
            "describing",
            "which",
            "rows",
            "columns"
