          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_together_they_let_focus_without",
          "text": "Together they let the model focus without discarding content, and they deliver new state of the art on three benchmarks along with stronger robustness to noise and to large tables.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
