          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c2_wikitq_reaches_sixty_nine_point_one",
          "text": "On WikiTQ it reaches sixty-nine point one percent exact-match accuracy, outperforming the strongest baseline in each category, including OmniTab, DATER, and fine-tuned Flan T5-xl by six point four, three point two, and four point seven absolute percentage points, and it beats much larger GPT-3 and Codex based in-context learning methods.",
