          "anchor_id": "cue_s08_c2_unsupervised_relevance_scorer_applyi",
          "text": "For the Unsupervised Relevance Scorer, applying clustering, centroid-separation, and sparsification losses together lifts WikiTQ accuracy from sixty point eight to sixty-five point six percent, whereas any subset gives little benefit, showing the three losses only help in combination.",
