          "anchor_id": "cue_s08_c3_two_relevance_signals_fusing_unsuper",
          "text": "For the two relevance signals, fusing the unsupervised score at weight zero point seven with the cell-based score at weight zero point three is optimal, giving sixty-nine point one percent on WikiTQ.",
